DOCUMENT(); loadMacros("PGstandard.pl","MathObjects.pl","PGML.pl"); TEXT(beginproblem());
Context("Numeric"); parser::Function->disable("Trig");
$f = Formula("(1+x)/2")->reduce;
BEGIN_PGML
**Problem 12.** Skriv \(\cos^2(t/2)\) som en funktion av \(x=\cos t\). Ange polynomet/rationella funktionen \(f(x)\) med \( \cos^2(t/2)=f(\cos t)\).

\(f(x)=\) [_]{$f}
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
